{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_17_level_main_17-06_beg","groupId":"main_17","stageId":"main_17-06","title":"理性失衡","storyCode":"17-7","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_17-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2ef8ecb7f77c2e6d1dbc0fecd3ceb7d5c66646189596af0aab308966e006c405","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"为Raidian寻找药品的路上，阿米娅被不明生物引至一位怪病发作的患者身边。在将其带到本地诊所后，她遇到了同在此处的希尔达。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g13_nobleroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_2232_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小将军的情况怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他已经睡下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_2232_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，他已经脱离了生命危险？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_2232_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，您也请休息吧。接下来我会守夜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_2232_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢您为将军所做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我只是平等地为每一个需要帮助的人送上抚慰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我还不累。我在想，也许这里还有更多人需要我的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想一个人再出去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_2232_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不能违抗您......但小将军的命令，是让您留在他的身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_2232_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他一会醒来后发现您离开了，他会很不高兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我保证，只是离开一会，请您给我一个机会......让我能多做一点事情，以充实自己的心灵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_2232_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，但请千万小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_2232_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在城里接收了更多感染者，没有人可以保证这些粗鄙的人是否会做出冒犯您的举动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会当心的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g2_exurbstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜托您，我的朋友现在状况很不好，我必须要拿到药物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我说了，在这里任何人夜间不得离开住所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"要么提交申请，等候通知，要么把病人交给我们，我们会把她送去可以治疗她的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你们不允许陪同！时间已经来不及了，我必须现在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"在日出之前不行，这是规定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_2238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"请回去吧，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你身后，草丛里——那是什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的招数是没用——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_2238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吼——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"滨河区发现目标踪迹，第三区附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收到。附近巡逻队伍已前往增援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，那个怪物，真的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"来人，来人！"},{"type":"narration","text":"卫兵匆匆回过身，迅速呼叫着守在建筑附近的同伴。\n阿米娅最后望了一眼草丛中穿梭的黑影，来不及犹豫，果断朝另一个方向跑去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g2_exurbstreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>泽尔格勒主城区</><p=2>1102年1月21日 01:25</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这里是白天进来时，人流量比较大的那条街。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"远处的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——对不起，对不起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"远处的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是在厂里检查锅炉温度耽误了时间，我马上就回去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电子音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"违反规定夜行，处罚款并拘留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电子音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"带走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"远处的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"饶了我吧，我不能耽误工时——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"远处的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看来必须得避开这些探照灯，可是这里为什么要这样严格地执行宵禁？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（希望能找到更多抑制源石技艺过载反应的药物。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（Raidian小姐......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"即使有路灯立在两旁，夜晚的泽尔格勒仍有些昏暗，似乎双月与星光都不曾到访。\n阿米娅在街道的边缘奔跑，躲避那些不断扫射的探照灯，同时在路边的建筑上挨个寻找着标牌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_2238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕呜呜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你......追你的那群人也在附近吗，他们为什么要抓你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_2238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（蹭上来）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_2238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拉扯阿米娅的裙摆）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......你要带我去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我现在没有时间——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_2238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜！"},{"type":"narration","text":"阴影中的“云兽”不住地拉扯着阿米娅的裙摆，试图将她引向附近昏暗的巷子深处。\n阿米娅沿着它所“指引”的方向望去，发现探照灯也正频繁地向那边扫射，却触及不到阴影覆盖的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是去看看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g14_dimunder"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在探照灯暂时无法触及的暗处，那倚在墙边的东西几乎已经不能被称之为“人”。\n绷带覆盖了他身上的大部分皮肤，露出的部分则呈现诡异而透明的绿色。\n一侧手臂上，那些皮肤和有限的肌肉组织，正在以类似苔藓的形状结块并脱落。\n他只能用更多的绷带将小臂缠住，似乎寄希望于这能减缓表皮和血肉离身体而去的速度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喑哑的嘶声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您——您身上，发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"穆尔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"穆尔，你在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_2238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“穆尔”？这是它的名字吗？"},{"type":"narration","text":"借着探照灯的一点光亮，阿米娅终于看清了身边的“云兽”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的生物 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_2238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......呜——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这怪异的生物发出几声低沉的呜咽，似乎是确认过阿米娅已经发现了身边的人，转眼间消失不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看不见......我看不见！穆尔，你去哪儿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......穆尔——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"身前，扭曲的人形步履蹒跚，缓慢走来，黏稠的皮肉被捆在绷带之下，摩擦出令人心怵的声响。\n再向前，他就要走进探照灯的照射范围下。阿米娅不得不冲上前去，在对方一无所知地暴露自己之前将他阻拦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当心——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您这是......得了什么病？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——有什么是我能帮您的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪，您的手......"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅下意识将倒下的人接住。一股腐败的沼泽一样的气息，正随着四肢剧烈的颤抖，不断从这人身上散发出来。\n而那同样也是死亡的气息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"穆尔......穆尔卡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......离我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再也，见不到。"},{"type":"narration","text":"再也......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g12_ursusroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"“再也见不到了。”\n在眼前人的迷茫和疼痛中，阿米娅再一次触碰到了令她痛苦的情绪。\n黑色的冠冕自虚空中浮现。\n在短暂的意识接触中，她看到简陋的房屋，看到出门后再也没有回来的女人和孩子，看到从窗台一跃而下的云兽——\n也看到一个带回了怪物的男人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“日前，新工业园区基地结构架设不全导致塌方，造成相邻园区学校师生十九死三十四伤。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“......据悉，截至发报日期，相关补贴已向家属发放完毕。对于此次事件，我们深表惋惜......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眼熟的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会再开窗了，穆尔。不会给你机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眼熟的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不会再开门了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眼熟的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论谁来，我都不会打开它们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眼熟的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要让这里，只有你和我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眼熟的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们永远......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“......园区实验动物丢失，如遇紧急情况，请拨打10103。将线索告知畜牧局可领取......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再也没有谁会离开谁，他们不能再从我身边夺走更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。就是这样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"基里尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"基里尔，你在家吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已经一周没在工厂里见过你了，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你还好，那就去跟工头说一声，正式请个假，好吗？我帮你说了，但我说的话不管用——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"基里尔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你能听到，请记得你还能依靠我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们是一个集体，记得吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g14_dimunder"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的症状，“穆尔”，还有那个门外的声音——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一切，究竟是......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i22"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（糟了，被发现了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（还有延迟时间，得想个办法把病人也带走。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（他昏迷了，必须赶快——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电子音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"发现目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电子音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请不要反抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电子音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第三区巡逻人员准备就位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，不能被抓住，否则情况会变得更复杂。我还没有弄清这个人的情况，这可能是泽尔格勒想要遮掩的——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（对了，在接驳区遇到的那个人，提到了“粉尘”“感染”，这里又出现了症状奇怪的病人。是的，是的！）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i22"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我必须——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电子音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请不要反抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电子音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请不要——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g14_dimunder"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_2260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快来，跟我走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_2260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这边！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g15_wideunder"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>泽尔格勒主城区，地下生活层</><p=2>1102年1月21日 02:16</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"街上空无一人......地下的空间里，却热闹许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才那个感染者给我指的路，是通往这里吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面出事了，快去叫几个人来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。小朋友？你怎么在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问，前面出什么事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"普罗霍尔，酒馆那个小老板，他死了！看样子是被人抢劫，杀了然后丢进下水道里去了。谁能想到在泽尔格勒还会发生这种事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水道清理人发现的，现在得去再叫几个人搭把手把尸体捞上来，等天亮再叫警察......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我跟你说这么多做什么！让开吧小妹妹，我急着去喊人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"力气上的事，我的确帮不上忙......抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g14_dimunder"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这里，就是那个发现尸体的地方吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（有人......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，请问——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊讶的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到人了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊讶的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，怎么来了个小孩。你家大人呢？这底下可不是你该来的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，我是想问路，请问你知道哪里有需要帮助的人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者，或者其他在病痛之中的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊讶的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这孩子说话真是奇怪，不过我大概能懂你意思。你是想找医院吧？家里人出了什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医院......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是可以的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊讶的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你现在出去会被抓起来的，孩子。如果你是急着要医生的帮助，那我给你指个地方吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊讶的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要有钱，那个人什么都肯治。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“从画着一个红色圆圈的大铁门出去，到地面之后，走没有路灯，也不会被探照灯‘关照’的那条路。”\n“一直往里走，走到一堵墙前面，蹲下去，试试推开。有松动的地方，就是能推开的‘门’。”\n“打开它，你会看到一个荒废的工厂，你要找的诊所和医生，就在里面。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"医生......医生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"帮帮我，给我止痛吧，我把我所有的“厂券”都给您！我真的受不了了，我能听见那些石头在我的皮肤里越长越多——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"医生说了，不能依赖药物，必须等你疼到一定程度了再给你用药，这样不会太快产生抗药性，而且持续效果更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再等等吧，再等等......咱们打了今天的药，白天还得回厂里去做工呢。你得趁机多休息一会儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我站不起来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是幻觉！你太疼了，除了疼什么都感觉不到。我看看这是几级疼痛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶，你是不是能用药了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快，帮我问——帮我问！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请让我来帮你们看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谁都好，帮帮我——求求你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么呢！咱们都不知道她是谁，万一——"},{"type":"narration","text":"希尔达走上前去，握住躺在担架上的感染者的双手。\n那双手冰凉，和腿上一样，皮肉中遍生细小的源石。若是发作起来，那种细密而绵长的疼痛，会轻易让死亡成为更可取的选项。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你干什么？！我要喊医生了，纳杰日达医生——医生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，你身上的源石，颜色变了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能做的不多，但至少，可以让他不再痛苦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......他死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，应该——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你才......死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*乌萨斯粗口*！我还以为——我还以为你这好运的家伙就这么到天上去了呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的不痛了......谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道你是谁，又是怎么做到的，但能不能看在这家伙是担心我的分上，也为他治疗一下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他是个没礼貌的东西，我替他向你道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用担心，我正是为此而来的......"},{"type":"narration","text":"她轻声说着，将坐在一旁的感染者的手也牵过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"很快，那奇异的力量就再次发挥了作用。在一阵令人晕眩的、温暖的光芒中，他感觉自己几乎重获新生，甚至直接从地上站了起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1731_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这太神奇了......！一下就治好了，比吃什么特效药都有用，这怎么可能呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1731_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟是什——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1731_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，纳杰日达医生！对不起，我没有觉得您的药不好的意思，绝对没有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐观的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1731_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纳杰日达医生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（应该就是在地下层里，那位先生提到的医生？）"},{"type":"narration","text":"希尔达转过头去，走廊尽头一处原本关闭的小门，此刻已经打开。\n门的内侧，透露出属于手术室的莹白灯光，门的外侧，则站着一个套着白袍戴着手套和口罩的中年人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，医生......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"医生摇了摇头，在用毛巾清洁了双手，重新戴上手套之后，她朝希尔达招了招手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你就是那个传说中能用源石技艺祛除疼痛症状的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你让我失去了不少病人，我猜到你可能会来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客观来说，你治了病，但主观来说，我因为你而失去了一大笔收入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为，您是个医生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生难道就不用吃饭了吗？而且从法律上讲，我已经不算医生了——我的执照被吊销了，现在是在无证行医。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是为了攒够能重新考证的钱才来到这里的，你说，我现在该拿砸了我饭碗的人怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我为您的遭遇感到遗憾，可即便如此，我也无法对那些需要帮助的病人无动于衷。"},{"type":"narration","text":"看到女孩紧张的表情，医生口罩遮挡下的面颊似乎松动了一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个不太合时宜的玩笑，别放在心上。这里的氛围已经够压抑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我的确很好奇，你怎么能够做到这么夸张的事？你拥有这样的源石技艺，却只是像圣愚一样四处布道，分文不取？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我无法向您解释我的力量......希望您相信，我并无恶意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，你看上去的确很可爱，可是按我自己对人性的理解，我不会相信一个付出不求回报的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，你到底来这里做什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌忙的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纳杰日达医生！快，急诊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌忙的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这回是个完全没见过的，病症看起来已经很严重——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌忙的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？希尔达小姐，你怎么也在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......几天不见，您看上去好些了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先别闲聊了，让我看看病人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴尔斯，马上去穿防护服，然后帮我准备手术用物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，你先去服用一支代谢阻断剂，然后立刻想办法通知瑭雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"手术我自己来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在平板床被推至自己身边时，希尔达听到病人痛苦而微弱的呼喊。\n她下意识伸出手去，想像先前一样施以援助，却没能给对方带去丝毫的慰藉。\n哀鸣着的病人被推进手术室，她一路追去，最终也只能在手术室门前，无措地放开了那只毫无生气的手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好......总算是找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你发现了病人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该......谢谢你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是力所能及的事......您也是这里的医生吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位病人的情况看上去很奇怪，我从来没有见过这样的矿石病症状......我甚至不确定这是否是矿石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是否知道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不是医生......尽管我希望自己是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我却治不好他们，我能做的事实在很有限......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我有点太着急了。看上去，您应该是位修士才对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，我刚才也没有注意到......你竟然也病得这样重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是说，我的病？......您怎么会知道我的病况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......你和那些人不一样，你病得很重，但你并没有在寻求救赎。我也不该对你做什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你身上背负的痛苦那么多，你为什么还能忍受......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我不明白——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i06"},{"type":"narration","text":"瘦小的卡特斯将目光投向了一墙之隔的手术室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我感受到痛苦......很多痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我本来以为自己已经不会再感受到痛苦了，可看到这些受苦的人们，我还是会感觉到......那么沉重的痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......神会让人们受苦呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她要用这样的痛苦考验人们......难道只有痛苦，才是神的法则？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i06"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅感到奇怪。\n眼前这位看上去较自己还要小一些的卡特斯，身上似乎有某种与年龄严重不符的悲悯气质。\n甚至没有黑冠的浮现，再一次，魔王的力量不自觉地将阿米娅的意识与身边的女孩联系在一起。\n她没有感知到鲜明的情绪，只觉得触碰到了一团缭乱的云雾，或是暗流涌动的海洋。女孩意识中那无边无际的悲哀几乎要将她吞没。\n阿米娅不愿意继续深入下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可据我所知，这并不是拉特兰的律法所提倡——抱歉，无意冒犯您的信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不相信有什么苦难是理所应当的，那些被施加的痛苦，是我们应当竭尽全力去对抗的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去帮助受苦的人，去战胜施害的人......这才是我们应该去做的事。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是，总有人无法得救的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"总有人会继续受苦，苦难也没有尽头......我们能做的事，真的还有意义吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你难道，不会绝望吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也许，会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果只有我一个人的话，我一定会感到绝望，甚至被绝望压垮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是我从来不是一个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人将她的理想告诉了我，她向我描绘了这片大地的另一番样貌......人们可以跨过隔阂，这片大地可以成为所有人共同的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她的理想也鼓舞了许多人，团结了许多人。我见证了这份理想被传递下来，我也相信会有更多人继承这一份理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我当然不知道怎样才能完全消除苦难，那应该是只有“神”才能做到的事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"苦难无法被终结，可是希望也同样会延续下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有人......共同的家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，请问他的情况怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在哪儿发现他的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在第一区，工厂旁边的巷子里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......基里尔自己的住所离那里很远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他应该是意识到自己活不久了，甚至不愿意在死后被认识他的人找到......可怜的瑭雅，她还在找他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我尽力了，他的基础生理机能已经被破坏殆尽了......我能做的只有减轻一点他的痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还能做到什么吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就算你有再神奇的源石技艺，大概也无法阻止人的生理机能走向完全的崩溃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过如果他醒来，你可以试试用你的源石技艺给他止痛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，你找到药物了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔小姐——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚找到医生，请等我一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纳杰日达医生！请问您这里有能够抑制源石技艺过载反应的药物吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石技艺过载反应？四肢无力或类似脑疲劳的症状，病人身上出现了哪种？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她直接昏迷了......我们携带的应急药物不够，能否请您分给我们一点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昏迷？听上去可真够严重的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不能把这种等级的药直接给你。我需要先检查病人的状态，我跟你走一趟吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于你，代谢阻断剂，拿上。我刚才的提议并非玩笑，如果你愿意，就留下来帮帮他吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你选择拒绝也没关系，自行离开就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴尔斯应该会带瑭雅过来，这个病人就是她要找的人。你也不用担心他会没人照看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对了。这位......阿米娅小姐？你接触过病人，也拿一支代谢阻断剂。现在我们不知道这种病的详情，这多少是个心理安慰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2222_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，我们走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......你是叫阿米娅，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫......希尔达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许，我还能再见——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"纳杰日达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"病人住在哪里？快点带路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的——抱歉，希尔达小姐......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我还能再见到你吗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g16_illegalclinics"},{"type":"narration","text":"在众人都离开之后，希尔达才缓步进入此前未曾踏足的手术室中。\n皮肉都异常脱落的病患已经被转移至病床上，四周拉起了透明防水布用作临时隔离，这让她看得不那么真切。\n于是希尔达走得更近了些。这样，她才能确认在那些新换的绷带下，病人的胸腔仍有微弱的起伏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗬......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你醒了？你感觉怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"帮我......帮我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我没办法帮你止疼。我试过了，我无法像对其他人那样，把你从痛苦中解放——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，我还能做些什么来让你感觉好受些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......杀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杀了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杀您......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我见不到，穆尔卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的穆尔卡——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不能起身——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳咳！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不该试着起身的，应该节省力气。如果把力气都消耗掉了，您之后会更疼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想做什么？请让我来帮您吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还去过了，我们第一次见面的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看见你坐着，怀里抱着云兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多奇怪啊。你们明明都已经不在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2226_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想做什么？......我想死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杀了我，别再给我希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别让她看到我现在的模样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，也许......也许我能——"},{"type":"narration","text":"她难以描述这突如其来的冲动。是完成他的愿望，还是尽力帮他不那么痛苦地继续活？\n没有决断。希尔达只是再次伸手，轻轻放在他剧烈起伏的胸膛之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我向您，再度祈求一个愿望。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（希望您的福泽，能平等地给予所有同胞。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（即使矿石病并非令他痛苦的缘由，即使他无从知晓您的名讳......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我衷心地希望，您能远离痛苦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"青色渗红的皮肤如苔藓般块块剥落。在那下面，原本柔软的血肉，已经变得坚硬。\n橙色的石头逐渐取代了他身体残余的每个部分，希尔达睁大了眼睛，她先前从未直面过这样的转变过程。\n一个小小的笑容，最终出现在病患的脸上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......如果，你能见到“穆尔”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请替我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感谢它的陪伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你做了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我没有看错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位小姐，能否请你解释一下——你对这位病人，到底做了什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g13_nobleroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>泽尔格勒扩展地块，元帅府邸</>\n少年用长刀轻巧地把身前的尸体拨弄到一边，从侍从手中接过干净的绢帕，缓慢擦拭着刀身上的血迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿纳托利","speakerId":"avg_npc_2235_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿纳托利","speakerId":"avg_npc_2235_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你们谁能告诉我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿纳托利","speakerId":"avg_npc_2235_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“不知道她在哪儿”，是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆大的侍从","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......希尔达小姐选择独自离开时，我们的确派人一路跟随，但在进入地下生活层之后丢失了她的踪迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆大的侍从","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我们立刻对她的去向展开了搜寻，目前已经锁定了一个范围，与我们此前多次尝试剿灭的感染者非法聚居区有大量重合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆大的侍从","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希尔达小姐......大概是主动去施行她的“神迹”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿纳托利","speakerId":"avg_npc_2235_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“施行神迹”......哼。究竟是谁允许她这样滥施恩惠，难道她觉得所有人都配得上这份救赎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"报告小将军！我们在追捕刺客时，于集体住宅第三区发现了非法集会行为！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"这些感染者违反了夜行禁令，且试图拒捕，也许是在为刺客打掩护——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"请下达指示！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿纳托利","speakerId":"avg_npc_2235_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆大的侍从","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第三区和希尔达小姐可能在的主城区都离我们不远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿纳托利","speakerId":"avg_npc_2235_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“可能在”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆大的侍从","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......事实上，我们已经完全锁定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿纳托利","speakerId":"avg_npc_2235_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们就先去第三区。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g16_illegalclinics"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕洪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1979_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来不及了......他的确已经死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕洪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1979_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师，我们都看到了，就是这个人刚刚对他使用了源石技艺，接着他就死了！"},{"type":"narration","text":"青年挥手制止了同伴继续说下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位小姐，我们绝对不愿意伤害手无寸铁的人，我们也希望你能告知我们一点信息，以证明你同样没有敌意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有伤害他......我只是不希望他继续忍受痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生对他得的病束手无策，我也没有办法挽回他的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他得了病？什么样的病？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是我想知道的......在来到这里之前，我也从来没有见过。"},{"type":"narration","text":"青年上前一步，来到病床旁，仔细观察着病人可怖的遗体......\n青年脸上的表情自始至终没有一丝波澜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这的确证实了我们的猜想。不管军方在泽尔格勒隐藏了什么秘密，它都在杀死这里的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泽尔格勒绝非感染者理想的庇护所，我们需要让更多人知道真相，然后带领大家离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕洪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1979_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说的对，可是我们现在连将大家聚集在一起都很难做到，怎么才能把消息传播出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......想要带这里的人们离开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还有同伴被收容在这里，他们一定会相信我......我可以联系他们，只要你愿意带他们一起离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，我们很希望可以信任你，可是你该如何证明你值得信任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我可以告诉你，那位小将军在这里的军队布防——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕洪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1979_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕洪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1979_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我们来的时候明明没有惊动任何警卫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许惊动他们的另有其人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没时间在意了，帕洪，按计划分队撤离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，至于你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你们......一起走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
